1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,588
Breakouts and the first signs of aging, both at once?

2
00:00:03,588 --> 00:00:08,538
In this review, we look at the Dermalogica AGE Bright Clearing Serum: what it is,

3
00:00:08,538 --> 00:00:10,493
what's in it, and how to use it.

4
00:00:10,493 --> 00:00:14,220
If you have adult breakouts, this one is worth knowing about.

5
00:00:14,981 --> 00:00:17,026
It's an active two-in-one serum.

6
00:00:17,026 --> 00:00:22,394
It clears breakouts and helps prevent new ones, while reducing visible signs of skin

7
00:00:22,394 --> 00:00:22,778
aging.

8
00:00:22,778 --> 00:00:27,954
So it is made for skin dealing with two concerns at the same time: breakouts, and

9
00:00:27,954 --> 00:00:29,424
visible signs of aging.

10
00:00:30,252 --> 00:00:34,499
The active ingredient is salicylic acid, at two point zero percent.

11
00:00:34,499 --> 00:00:39,761
Salicylic acid is the ingredient doing the breakout-clearing work in this serum, so

12
00:00:39,761 --> 00:00:41,346
it's the one to remember.

13
00:00:42,109 --> 00:00:43,419
Next is niacinamide.

14
00:00:43,419 --> 00:00:46,956
It's second on the ingredient list, right after water.

15
00:00:46,956 --> 00:00:52,392
That means it's one of the main ingredients in the formula, not just a small extra.

16
00:00:53,092 --> 00:00:57,672
Niacinamide is paired with white shiitake mushroom, for a brighter, more

17
00:00:57,672 --> 00:00:59,136
even-looking skin tone.

18
00:00:59,136 --> 00:01:03,652
So while salicylic acid works on breakouts, this pairing works on tone.

19
00:01:04,416 --> 00:01:09,664
Then there's the AGE Bright Complex, which works with the skin's natural microbiome.

20
00:01:10,364 --> 00:01:14,970
And phytoactives from the resurrection plant help hydrate and smooth the skin.

21
00:01:14,970 --> 00:01:17,745
So the formula clears, brightens, and hydrates.

22
00:01:18,445 --> 00:01:21,197
All of that comes in a thirty milliliter serum bottle.

23
00:01:21,897 --> 00:01:23,110
Now, how to use it.

24
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:26,750
After cleansing, apply a thin layer, and allow it to dry.

25
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:28,602
A thin layer is all you need.

26
00:01:28,602 --> 00:01:31,028
Let it dry fully before the next step.

27
00:01:31,728 --> 00:01:33,889
Then follow with your moisturizer.

28
00:01:33,889 --> 00:01:36,685
You can use it up to twice a day, as needed.

29
00:01:36,685 --> 00:01:40,752
It is a serum, so it goes on before your moisturizer, not after.

30
00:01:41,452 --> 00:01:44,497
If your skin is sensitive, build up to daily use.

31
00:01:44,497 --> 00:01:49,345
And if you're sensitive to salicylic acid, do a patch test first, or avoid it.

32
00:01:50,045 --> 00:01:55,138
So, the AGE Bright Clearing Serum: two point zero percent salicylic acid,

33
00:01:55,138 --> 00:02:00,650
niacinamide with white shiitake mushroom, and the AGE Bright Complex, in a thin

34
00:02:00,650 --> 00:02:03,999
layer under your moisturizer, up to twice a day.

35
00:02:03,999 --> 00:02:06,161
The link is in the description.
